(4625469, 666047, 84520, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  It would work better if the gun was in focus, and the man was either out of focus or just fading out of the plane of sharpness.  Right now, it conflicts with the ''language'' of having a gun pointed at you--the man is interesting, but the gun is what matters!</td>', 'I like this shot.  It would work better if the gun was in focus, and the man was either out of focus or just fading out of the plane of sharpness.  Right now, it conflicts with the ''language'' of having a gun pointed at you--the man is interesting, but the gun is what matters!', '2008-04-09 01:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
