(4626938, 667243, 13207, '<td valign="top">It seems to me that many pictures of statues end up somewhat bland - this, for me, is one of them.  Perhaps a closer crop or different shot angle would have given this shot a little more ommph, but as it is right now I find the background to be very distracting from the subject and the b&amp;w treatment seems to make this image very flat.</td>', 'It seems to me that many pictures of statues end up somewhat bland - this, for me, is one of them.  Perhaps a closer crop or different shot angle would have given this shot a little more ommph, but as it is right now I find the background to be very distracting from the subject and the b&w treatment seems to make this image very flat.', '2008-04-09 12:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4626940, 666403, 56254, '<td valign="top">I think this photo would be stronger if the cat were looking at the camera, engaging the viewer ...</td>', 'I think this photo would be stronger if the cat were looking at the camera, engaging the viewer ...', '2008-04-09 12:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
