(4630179, 667243, 75651, '<td valign="top">Great focus and turning it balck and white to accent the highlights and shadows more than the colors was probably a good idea for the subject. nice job.</td>', 'Great focus and turning it balck and white to accent the highlights and shadows more than the colors was probably a good idea for the subject. nice job.', '2008-04-10 13:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
