(4630184, 666969, 75651, '<td valign="top">CRitters!!  I like it, the only thing that really bothers me is that the tail is cut off.  A squirrels tail is like it''s signature, each unique to the owner.  Please included that tail and you have yourself a photo.</td>', 'CRitters!!  I like it, the only thing that really bothers me is that the tail is cut off.  A squirrels tail is like it''s signature, each unique to the owner.  Please included that tail and you have yourself a photo.', '2008-04-10 13:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
