(4632194, 667370, 30982, '<td valign="top">I like the dual meaning here - the centered photo, centering of the clay.  (My sister is a potter.)</td>', 'I like the dual meaning here - the centered photo, centering of the clay.  (My sister is a potter.)', '2008-04-11 04:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632202, 666047, 30982, '<td valign="top">Comment only - I really dislike having guns pointed at me, even if only in a photograph.  This meets the challenge, but if it isn''t scoring as well as you''d like, it may be that others share my dislike and are voting.  You will also get those who want the gun in focus (which of course would miss the point of the picture - to me it''s the person behind the gun, not the object itself.)</td>', 'Comment only - I really dislike having guns pointed at me, even if only in a photograph.  This meets the challenge, but if it isn''t scoring as well as you''d like, it may be that others share my dislike and are voting.  You will also get those who want the gun in focus (which of course would miss the point of the picture - to me it''s the person behind the gun, not the object itself.)', '2008-04-11 04:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632217, 665989, 48579, '<td valign="top">If your fingers were lit, this would have been a super shot!</td>', 'If your fingers were lit, this would have been a super shot!', '2008-04-11 05:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
