(4632237, 667313, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very lovely baby portrait.  This would look quite nice hanging on the parents'' wall.</td>', 'A very lovely baby portrait.  This would look quite nice hanging on the parents'' wall.', '2008-04-11 06:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
