(4632245, 667230, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject for the challenge and very well composed.  Hurt a bit by the lack of clean, crisp focus to really show off the detail.</td>', 'Good choice of subject for the challenge and very well composed.  Hurt a bit by the lack of clean, crisp focus to really show off the detail.', '2008-04-11 06:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
