(4632259, 666848, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice to see the bluebonnets in bloom.  Good portrait, too - casual and comfortable.</td>', 'Nice to see the bluebonnets in bloom.  Good portrait, too - casual and comfortable.', '2008-04-11 07:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632268, 667407, 30982, '<td valign="top">A good concept, with good color.  It might have more impact if shot from above, and you need crisp, clean focus with this kind of shot - soft doesn''t really add to it.</td>', 'A good concept, with good color.  It might have more impact if shot from above, and you need crisp, clean focus with this kind of shot - soft doesn''t really add to it.', '2008-04-11 07:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632271, 666887, 30982, '<td valign="top">That''s one very patient and well-behaved bird.  Great light, great detail.</td>', 'That''s one very patient and well-behaved bird.  Great light, great detail.', '2008-04-11 07:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632276, 666418, 30982, '<td valign="top">For some reason, he doesn''t look like he''s buying the whole "spring" thing.  Nice shot for the challenge.</td>', 'For some reason, he doesn''t look like he''s buying the whole "spring" thing.  Nice shot for the challenge.', '2008-04-11 07:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632279, 666004, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of the theme in this - works well in my opinion.</td>', 'Very nice use of the theme in this - works well in my opinion.', '2008-04-11 07:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632282, 667163, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very neat view of this guy.  Some odd artifacting around the ties to the sides, but a very good shot.  Great detail, excellent angle.</td>', 'Very neat view of this guy.  Some odd artifacting around the ties to the sides, but a very good shot.  Great detail, excellent angle.', '2008-04-11 07:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632309, 665973, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the moment. I especially love the two players in the background, slightly out of focus to keep the emphasis on the pitcher, but heightening the anticipation. Excellent shot. In a perfect world the left foot would not be cut off nor the 1st baseman''s leg, but not a big impact overall.</td>', 'Great capture of the moment. I especially love the two players in the background, slightly out of focus to keep the emphasis on the pitcher, but heightening the anticipation. Excellent shot. In a perfect world the left foot would not be cut off nor the 1st baseman''s leg, but not a big impact overall.', '2008-04-11 07:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632310, 666977, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great lighting in the clouds!</td>', 'Great lighting in the clouds!', '2008-04-11 07:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632311, 666132, 88204, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but not quite sharp enough.</td>', 'Nice shot but not quite sharp enough.', '2008-04-11 07:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632313, 666579, 88204, '<td valign="top">I like the concept. I wish we could see an expression on the face. That would make the shot.</td>', 'I like the concept. I wish we could see an expression on the face. That would make the shot.', '2008-04-11 07:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632314, 667313, 88204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and color!</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and color!', '2008-04-11 07:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632315, 666710, 88204, '<td valign="top">Cute expression!</td>', 'Cute expression!', '2008-04-11 07:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632316, 665480, 88204, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset and great concept. Dust is distracting and there seems to be a slight yellow cast on the base and table.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset and great concept. Dust is distracting and there seems to be a slight yellow cast on the base and table.', '2008-04-11 07:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632318, 666308, 88204, '<td valign="top">Cute expression. Lighting is a little harsh and flat.</td>', 'Cute expression. Lighting is a little harsh and flat.', '2008-04-11 07:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632320, 666059, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great sky, beautiful colors. In an ideal world the blossoms would not block the monument. Great sharpness on foreground buds, middle ground monument and background sky.</td>', 'Great sky, beautiful colors. In an ideal world the blossoms would not block the monument. Great sharpness on foreground buds, middle ground monument and background sky.', '2008-04-11 07:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632323, 666822, 88204, '<td valign="top">Haven''t I seen this same girl in the bluebonnets in this challenge already? Were there two photographers shooting the same model? Beautiful girl, nice setting and pose. Nice even lighting on the face... did you use reflectors to get the warm glow on the face? fill flash? Nice shot.</td>', 'Haven''t I seen this same girl in the bluebonnets in this challenge already? Were there two photographers shooting the same model? Beautiful girl, nice setting and pose. Nice even lighting on the face... did you use reflectors to get the warm glow on the face? fill flash? Nice shot.', '2008-04-11 07:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632325, 667159, 88204, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and desaturation. The pose leaves me on the edge of my seat because it looks so unnatural, as if something needs to happen. Interesting shot.</td>', 'Nice lighting and desaturation. The pose leaves me on the edge of my seat because it looks so unnatural, as if something needs to happen. Interesting shot.', '2008-04-11 07:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632328, 667028, 77543, '<td valign="top">Funny.<br/>The shadows are very harsh, though.</td>', 'Funny.The shadows are very harsh, though.', '2008-04-11 07:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632329, 667392, 88204, '<td valign="top">This shot really caught my eye. It reminds me of an old western or 50s movie... something about teh framing, expression, haircut... I don''t know what. Perfect lighting. Background is intruiging. Use of the mirror is nice too. Love it. One of my favorites in the challenge.</td>', 'This shot really caught my eye. It reminds me of an old western or 50s movie... something about teh framing, expression, haircut... I don''t know what. Perfect lighting. Background is intruiging. Use of the mirror is nice too. Love it. One of my favorites in the challenge.', '2008-04-11 07:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632335, 667288, 88204, '<td valign="top">Love the expression and the out of focus person. The title is too literal for me.</td>', 'Love the expression and the out of focus person. The title is too literal for me.', '2008-04-11 08:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632337, 666835, 88204, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Great complementary colors. Seems slightly oversharpened.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Great complementary colors. Seems slightly oversharpened.', '2008-04-11 08:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632357, 666957, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: Unconventional crop that makes this image work exceptionally well for this challenge. 9</td>', 'Back to comment: Unconventional crop that makes this image work exceptionally well for this challenge. 9', '2008-04-11 08:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632365, 667411, 88083, '<td valign="top">Engaging photo. Wide angle works well, as the bleak walls funnel the viewer to the point of focus.  Great tonal range.  White bureau, drawer left ajar, is an excellent focal point.  Nice photo.</td>', 'Engaging photo. Wide angle works well, as the bleak walls funnel the viewer to the point of focus.  Great tonal range.  White bureau, drawer left ajar, is an excellent focal point.  Nice photo.', '2008-04-11 08:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632368, 667370, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: A very artisitic photograph.  The colors are rich and the compostion tells the story.  9</td>', 'Back to comment: A very artisitic photograph.  The colors are rich and the compostion tells the story.  9', '2008-04-11 08:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632382, 667156, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment: What''s not to love about the hair style?  I find it difficult to make a connection with the subject with his eyes facing up and out of the image.  It also appears as if the back (his left) eye is in better focus than the front eye.  This might be an illusion related to the stronger white tone of the back eye from the side light.  I bet mom still loves it.</td>', 'Back to comment: What''s not to love about the hair style?  I find it difficult to make a connection with the subject with his eyes facing up and out of the image.  It also appears as if the back (his left) eye is in better focus than the front eye.  This might be an illusion related to the stronger white tone of the back eye from the side light.  I bet mom still loves it.', '2008-04-11 08:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632385, 666736, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump:  I orginally gave this a 5, as my definition of centered was dead center both horizontal and vertical.  Taking a second look, you did a really nice job with the shallow focus and the lighting.  The only suggestion I have for improvement would be to include the ladies eyes in the image.  It would have really strengthened the connection between the flower and the lady for me.  Bumping to a 7.</td>', 'Back to comment and bump:  I orginally gave this a 5, as my definition of centered was dead center both horizontal and vertical.  Taking a second look, you did a really nice job with the shallow focus and the lighting.  The only suggestion I have for improvement would be to include the ladies eyes in the image.  It would have really strengthened the connection between the flower and the lady for me.  Bumping to a 7.', '2008-04-11 08:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632409, 666466, 30982, '<td valign="top">It looks like Jeb...</td>', 'It looks like Jeb...', '2008-04-11 09:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632431, 666937, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice.  Looks like you might have been the hunter - beautiful light captured too.</td>', '8 - Very nice.  Looks like you might have been the hunter - beautiful light captured too.', '2008-04-11 09:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
