(4632588, 667050, 70270, '<td valign="top">Now THAT is a centered composition.  Makes effective use of the technique rather than just plunking the subject down in the middle.  Great focus and DOF.  The horse looks like a smiling camel.  10.</td>', 'Now THAT is a centered composition.  Makes effective use of the technique rather than just plunking the subject down in the middle.  Great focus and DOF.  The horse looks like a smiling camel.  10.', '2008-04-11 10:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
