(4632640, 665764, 77543, '<td valign="top">I''d have cropped closer to remove the train. Just the track would work very well in this challenge.</td>', 'I''d have cropped closer to remove the train. Just the track would work very well in this challenge.', '2008-04-11 11:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
