(4632647, 666525, 77543, '<td valign="top">The border is very heavy. I wonder whether this picture would have been better for this challenge without the child.</td>', 'The border is very heavy. I wonder whether this picture would have been better for this challenge without the child.', '2008-04-11 11:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632649, 667054, 77543, '<td valign="top">The background is very busy despite being out of focus.</td>', 'The background is very busy despite being out of focus.', '2008-04-11 11:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632650, 667403, 77543, '<td valign="top">There seems to be a colour cast or it''s over-saturated.</td>', 'There seems to be a colour cast or it''s over-saturated.', '2008-04-11 11:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632661, 666353, 77543, '<td valign="top">I''m not keen on the black bands at the top on bottom of the frame. Removing them and having a wider aspect ratio would give it a more "wide screen cinema" feel which would suit the subject well.</td>', 'I''m not keen on the black bands at the top on bottom of the frame. Removing them and having a wider aspect ratio would give it a more "wide screen cinema" feel which would suit the subject well.', '2008-04-11 11:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632664, 667409, 77543, '<td valign="top">It looks a bit washed out. More contrast would help.</td>', 'It looks a bit washed out. More contrast would help.', '2008-04-11 11:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632665, 667358, 674, '<td valign="top">lovely shot slightly oversharp 9</td>', 'lovely shot slightly oversharp 9', '2008-04-11 11:17:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632679, 666186, 674, '<td valign="top">lovely depth of field but I would have cropped the dark patch on thhe left off 8</td>', 'lovely depth of field but I would have cropped the dark patch on thhe left off 8', '2008-04-11 11:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632699, 667346, 674, '<td valign="top">lovely colours but somewhat oversharpened and you have cut his tail off maybe a portrait crop would have given you the whole bird. 7</td>', 'lovely colours but somewhat oversharpened and you have cut his tail off maybe a portrait crop would have given you the whole bird. 7', '2008-04-11 11:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632700, 665723, 77543, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot but it doesn''t feel centred to me. I see the subject as the aircraft and their trails. Together these are in the top right of the frame.</td>', 'This is a great shot but it doesn''t feel centred to me. I see the subject as the aircraft and their trails. Together these are in the top right of the frame.', '2008-04-11 11:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632705, 665747, 77543, '<td valign="top">If I just saw the head it would be centred but since I can see the body as well the subject now sits in the bottom left of the frame and so isn''t centred.</td>', 'If I just saw the head it would be centred but since I can see the body as well the subject now sits in the bottom left of the frame and so isn''t centred.', '2008-04-11 11:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632706, 666835, 674, '<td valign="top">the background looks so oversharp it appears unreal</td>', 'the background looks so oversharp it appears unreal', '2008-04-11 11:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632709, 666957, 674, '<td valign="top">would do well in a symetical challenge</td>', 'would do well in a symetical challenge', '2008-04-11 11:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632712, 667079, 77543, '<td valign="top">I''d have used a more diffuse light source to remove the harsh highlights.</td>', 'I''d have used a more diffuse light source to remove the harsh highlights.', '2008-04-11 11:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632714, 666132, 77543, '<td valign="top">The focus is a bit soft.</td>', 'The focus is a bit soft.', '2008-04-11 11:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632716, 665764, 81530, '<td valign="top">Good composition.</td>', 'Good composition.', '2008-04-11 11:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632720, 666642, 77543, '<td valign="top">The background dominates this image.</td>', 'The background dominates this image.', '2008-04-11 11:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632722, 667243, 77543, '<td valign="top">The background is too busy.</td>', 'The background is too busy.', '2008-04-11 11:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632724, 665254, 77543, '<td valign="top">For this challenge I''d like to see more symmetry and the lower "ball" has been cut off.</td>', 'For this challenge I''d like to see more symmetry and the lower "ball" has been cut off.', '2008-04-11 11:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632726, 666705, 77543, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting abstract. I''m not sure it fits this challenge that well, though - it feels off -centre.</td>', 'This is an interesting abstract. I''m not sure it fits this challenge that well, though - it feels off -centre.', '2008-04-11 11:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632731, 666244, 81530, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering why the shoulder on the right is distinguishable from the background, but the one on the left is not. Was this done on purpose?</td>', 'I''m wondering why the shoulder on the right is distinguishable from the background, but the one on the left is not. Was this done on purpose?', '2008-04-11 11:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632733, 667412, 81530, '<td valign="top">Nice motion capture. The hole in the aluminum is a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice motion capture. The hole in the aluminum is a little distracting.', '2008-04-11 11:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632735, 667182, 81530, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this shot without the painting in the background.</td>', 'I would like to see this shot without the painting in the background.', '2008-04-11 11:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632738, 667394, 81530, '<td valign="top">Very grainy overall.</td>', 'Very grainy overall.', '2008-04-11 11:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632742, 666607, 81530, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting on the cat</td>', 'Very nice lighting on the cat', '2008-04-11 11:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632744, 666579, 81530, '<td valign="top">It would be nice to see more of the person, but this is still very nice. I would like to see the horizon line straightened.</td>', 'It would be nice to see more of the person, but this is still very nice. I would like to see the horizon line straightened.', '2008-04-11 11:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632745, 665992, 81530, '<td valign="top">The crop feels a little tight at the bottom.</td>', 'The crop feels a little tight at the bottom.', '2008-04-11 11:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632747, 666429, 81530, '<td valign="top">Good environmental portrait</td>', 'Good environmental portrait', '2008-04-11 11:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632748, 665333, 81530, '<td valign="top">My attention is drawn to the right, and not the center</td>', 'My attention is drawn to the right, and not the center', '2008-04-11 11:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632755, 666010, 81530, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot. A reflected flash might work better because it will reduce the flare on the mask, and reduce the shadows between the mask and the wall.</td>', 'This is a good shot. A reflected flash might work better because it will reduce the flare on the mask, and reduce the shadows between the mask and the wall.', '2008-04-11 11:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632756, 666320, 81530, '<td valign="top">Nice variety of colours</td>', 'Nice variety of colours', '2008-04-11 11:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632757, 667373, 81530, '<td valign="top">Seems a little red overall.</td>', 'Seems a little red overall.', '2008-04-11 11:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632759, 665237, 81530, '<td valign="top">There are many elements fighting for attention here.</td>', 'There are many elements fighting for attention here.', '2008-04-11 11:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632761, 667253, 81530, '<td valign="top">Nice idea here, could be a little sharper.</td>', 'Nice idea here, could be a little sharper.', '2008-04-11 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632773, 666636, 81530, '<td valign="top">The background fights for attention because of all the texture</td>', 'The background fights for attention because of all the texture', '2008-04-11 11:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632775, 667257, 81530, '<td valign="top">Good fire shot, however I don''t get the feeling of being centered.</td>', 'Good fire shot, however I don''t get the feeling of being centered.', '2008-04-11 12:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632776, 665479, 77543, '<td valign="top">The diagonal makes this more interesting.</td>', 'The diagonal makes this more interesting.', '2008-04-11 12:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632777, 667044, 77543, '<td valign="top">I wish his head covered the whole of the bright area at the back.</td>', 'I wish his head covered the whole of the bright area at the back.', '2008-04-11 12:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632780, 666460, 77543, '<td valign="top">Taking the subject to be the whole bird  that goes from its beak to its tail then it is not in the centre but on the centre right of the frame.</td>', 'Taking the subject to be the whole bird  that goes from its beak to its tail then it is not in the centre but on the centre right of the frame.', '2008-04-11 12:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632781, 667134, 77543, '<td valign="top">The reeds in the foreground are in the way and spoil this.</td>', 'The reeds in the foreground are in the way and spoil this.', '2008-04-11 12:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632782, 667208, 81530, '<td valign="top">Looks like warp speed.</td>', 'Looks like warp speed.', '2008-04-11 12:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632783, 666382, 77543, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see more contrast - perhaps the arch could be darker.</td>', 'I''d like to see more contrast - perhaps the arch could be darker.', '2008-04-11 12:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632784, 667370, 81530, '<td valign="top">I like the composition.</td>', 'I like the composition.', '2008-04-11 12:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632785, 665434, 81530, '<td valign="top">The light is a little bright on the lemons</td>', 'The light is a little bright on the lemons', '2008-04-11 12:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632786, 667243, 81530, '<td valign="top">There is a lot going on in the background to distract from the stone companion</td>', 'There is a lot going on in the background to distract from the stone companion', '2008-04-11 12:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632788, 665712, 81530, '<td valign="top">very subdued colour</td>', 'very subdued colour', '2008-04-11 12:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632790, 666258, 77543, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot going on in the background.</td>', 'There''s a lot going on in the background.', '2008-04-11 12:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632793, 667281, 81530, '<td valign="top">Might be able to take a little more brightness.</td>', 'Might be able to take a little more brightness.', '2008-04-11 12:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632794, 666173, 77543, '<td valign="top">I''d have tried a lower camera angle so just the fence was in the background. This would have made a cleaner shot.</td>', 'I''d have tried a lower camera angle so just the fence was in the background. This would have made a cleaner shot.', '2008-04-11 12:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632796, 666151, 81530, '<td valign="top">Very nice silhouettes. I like the texture in the background as well.</td>', 'Very nice silhouettes. I like the texture in the background as well.', '2008-04-11 12:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632799, 667079, 81530, '<td valign="top">It would be nice if the colour of the shoes really stood out</td>', 'It would be nice if the colour of the shoes really stood out', '2008-04-11 12:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632800, 665421, 77543, '<td valign="top">It''s good that the background is naturally monochrome - it helps the subject stand out.</td>', 'It''s good that the background is naturally monochrome - it helps the subject stand out.', '2008-04-11 12:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632801, 666608, 77543, '<td valign="top">I expect this looked much more impressive in 3D than it does as a flat image.</td>', 'I expect this looked much more impressive in 3D than it does as a flat image.', '2008-04-11 12:09:39.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4632804, 667165, 81530, '<td valign="top">They could be more centered in the photograph.</td>', 'They could be more centered in the photograph.', '2008-04-11 12:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632805, 665213, 81530, '<td valign="top">I like the mood overall.</td>', 'I like the mood overall.', '2008-04-11 12:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632807, 667375, 81530, '<td valign="top">The crop is a little tight at the bottom</td>', 'The crop is a little tight at the bottom', '2008-04-11 12:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632809, 667117, 81530, '<td valign="top">Nice details overall.</td>', 'Nice details overall.', '2008-04-11 12:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632811, 666881, 81530, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a dome in a cathedral</td>', 'Reminds me of a dome in a cathedral', '2008-04-11 12:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632812, 666959, 77543, '<td valign="top">The position of the legs and body make an interesting shape. It''s a pity there is so much foliage in the way.</td>', 'The position of the legs and body make an interesting shape. It''s a pity there is so much foliage in the way.', '2008-04-11 12:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632816, 667276, 81530, '<td valign="top">A little bland colourwise, with exception of the grass</td>', 'A little bland colourwise, with exception of the grass', '2008-04-11 12:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632817, 667183, 77543, '<td valign="top">That sums up a cat''s life very well.<br/>:-)</td>', 'That sums up a cat''s life very well.:-)', '2008-04-11 12:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632819, 665297, 81530, '<td valign="top">I think if this were a square crop, the viewer would focus more on the cat because their gaze would not be drawn away by all the horizontal lines.</td>', 'I think if this were a square crop, the viewer would focus more on the cat because their gaze would not be drawn away by all the horizontal lines.', '2008-04-11 12:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632820, 667241, 81530, '<td valign="top">A little dark overall.</td>', 'A little dark overall.', '2008-04-11 12:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632821, 666350, 77543, '<td valign="top">The strong leading lines on the right work well but they don''t seem to be balanced by what is happening on the upper and left of the frame.</td>', 'The strong leading lines on the right work well but they don''t seem to be balanced by what is happening on the upper and left of the frame.', '2008-04-11 12:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632822, 666217, 81530, '<td valign="top">A little dark overall. The crop at the bottom is a little tight.</td>', 'A little dark overall. The crop at the bottom is a little tight.', '2008-04-11 12:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632823, 666746, 77543, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting effect. I''d have cropped the top left object in the background.</td>', 'This is an interesting effect. I''d have cropped the top left object in the background.', '2008-04-11 12:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632829, 666632, 77543, '<td valign="top">The petals have an unusual feel to them. I''d like to see this cropped very tight to remove all of the background.</td>', 'The petals have an unusual feel to them. I''d like to see this cropped very tight to remove all of the background.', '2008-04-11 12:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632833, 666308, 77543, '<td valign="top">The use of on-camera flash has created a harsh shadow and "blue eye".</td>', 'The use of on-camera flash has created a harsh shadow and "blue eye".', '2008-04-11 12:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632835, 666642, 81530, '<td valign="top">Very painterly photograph</td>', 'Very painterly photograph', '2008-04-11 12:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632836, 666109, 81530, '<td valign="top">Good subject choice for the challenge.</td>', 'Good subject choice for the challenge.', '2008-04-11 12:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632837, 666044, 81530, '<td valign="top">My attention gets drawn to the teddy bear because it is much lighter than the statue</td>', 'My attention gets drawn to the teddy bear because it is much lighter than the statue', '2008-04-11 12:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632838, 667230, 81530, '<td valign="top">Interesting circular feel</td>', 'Interesting circular feel', '2008-04-11 12:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632840, 666665, 81530, '<td valign="top">A closer crop might make the "X" feel more centered.</td>', 'A closer crop might make the "X" feel more centered.', '2008-04-11 12:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632842, 666132, 81530, '<td valign="top">It''s interesting to see a green background with snow in the air.</td>', 'It''s interesting to see a green background with snow in the air.', '2008-04-11 12:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632844, 665527, 77543, '<td valign="top">I like the clean lines in the snow. I like the snow covered trees. The subject in the centre looks interesting. But overall this picture doesn''t seem to hang together. Perhaps I would have got closer to the subject or shot it from another angle.</td>', 'I like the clean lines in the snow. I like the snow covered trees. The subject in the centre looks interesting. But overall this picture doesn''t seem to hang together. Perhaps I would have got closer to the subject or shot it from another angle.', '2008-04-11 12:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632847, 665992, 77543, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between the near and far.</td>', 'Nice contrast between the near and far.', '2008-04-11 12:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632854, 666969, 77543, '<td valign="top">As this isn''t a close-up with this much of the squirrel in the frame I''d like to see the whole animal including the tail.</td>', 'As this isn''t a close-up with this much of the squirrel in the frame I''d like to see the whole animal including the tail.', '2008-04-11 12:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632859, 667123, 77543, '<td valign="top">The colours of this creature blend into the background.</td>', 'The colours of this creature blend into the background.', '2008-04-11 12:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632860, 667289, 77683, '<td valign="top">the horizon being unlevel is distracting</td>', 'the horizon being unlevel is distracting', '2008-04-11 12:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632861, 666969, 81530, '<td valign="top">I''d be tempted to have a tighter crop and put the squirrels face dead center.</td>', 'I''d be tempted to have a tighter crop and put the squirrels face dead center.', '2008-04-11 12:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632863, 666159, 77543, '<td valign="top">There''s a patch of light in the top right of the frame.</td>', 'There''s a patch of light in the top right of the frame.', '2008-04-11 12:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632866, 666706, 72782, '<td valign="top">Fun shot</td>', 'Fun shot', '2008-04-11 12:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632870, 667307, 77543, '<td valign="top">The trees contrast well with the subject but the lighter areas of the background don''t work as well.</td>', 'The trees contrast well with the subject but the lighter areas of the background don''t work as well.', '2008-04-11 12:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632871, 666508, 77543, '<td valign="top">This is very abstract.</td>', 'This is very abstract.', '2008-04-11 12:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632872, 666544, 81530, '<td valign="top">Is that a bag of potato chips in her hand? :D</td>', 'Is that a bag of potato chips in her hand? :D', '2008-04-11 12:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632874, 667298, 72782, '<td valign="top">Really like the parallel curves</td>', 'Really like the parallel curves', '2008-04-11 12:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632876, 667294, 81530, '<td valign="top">Good colour in the sky</td>', 'Good colour in the sky', '2008-04-11 12:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632877, 667237, 77543, '<td valign="top">Well exposed and nice curves in the water.</td>', 'Well exposed and nice curves in the water.', '2008-04-11 12:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632878, 666427, 81530, '<td valign="top">Nice soft feeling overall.</td>', 'Nice soft feeling overall.', '2008-04-11 12:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632881, 667392, 81530, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, especially the highlight on his face.</td>', 'Nice lighting, especially the highlight on his face.', '2008-04-11 12:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632883, 667312, 72782, '<td valign="top">Very exciting image</td>', 'Very exciting image', '2008-04-11 12:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632885, 665685, 48576, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract - good composition and focus.</td>', 'Nice abstract - good composition and focus.', '2008-04-11 12:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632887, 666938, 77543, '<td valign="top">I''d crop to remove the curves at the top of the frame. This would make more of the strong verticals and keep it simpler.</td>', 'I''d crop to remove the curves at the top of the frame. This would make more of the strong verticals and keep it simpler.', '2008-04-11 12:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632889, 667158, 77543, '<td valign="top">I think this would be more interesting if we could see her eyes.</td>', 'I think this would be more interesting if we could see her eyes.', '2008-04-11 12:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632891, 667195, 48576, '<td valign="top">Good focus and framing.  Well lit as well. Looks  like a nice shot for stock photography.</td>', 'Good focus and framing.  Well lit as well. Looks  like a nice shot for stock photography.', '2008-04-11 12:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632892, 666425, 77543, '<td valign="top">I wonder if this would have been better with a very long exposure to blur the water.</td>', 'I wonder if this would have been better with a very long exposure to blur the water.', '2008-04-11 12:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632893, 666466, 48576, '<td valign="top">Interesting colour and angle here.</td>', 'Interesting colour and angle here.', '2008-04-11 12:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632895, 667390, 81530, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the feeling of being centered.</td>', 'I don''t get the feeling of being centered.', '2008-04-11 12:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632898, 667157, 77543, '<td valign="top">The composition works well for this challenge. I don''t like the white in the background at the top and it could do with a little more contrast.</td>', 'The composition works well for this challenge. I don''t like the white in the background at the top and it could do with a little more contrast.', '2008-04-11 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632901, 667407, 77543, '<td valign="top">Good use of the curves in the plate.</td>', 'Good use of the curves in the plate.', '2008-04-11 12:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632906, 667376, 77543, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subject. I wonder whether seeing more of the leaves would help.</td>', 'Good choice of subject. I wonder whether seeing more of the leaves would help.', '2008-04-11 12:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632907, 666719, 77543, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the "twist". How did it look straight?</td>', 'I''m not sure about the "twist". How did it look straight?', '2008-04-11 12:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632909, 666608, 81530, '<td valign="top">Good use of the rule of thirds.</td>', 'Good use of the rule of thirds.', '2008-04-11 12:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632910, 666430, 77543, '<td valign="top">An interesting plant.<br/>Slightly more depth of field was needed to keep it all sharp.</td>', 'An interesting plant.Slightly more depth of field was needed to keep it all sharp.', '2008-04-11 12:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632911, 665662, 77543, '<td valign="top">Good lighting</td>', 'Good lighting', '2008-04-11 12:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4632912, 665685, 77543, '<td valign="top">I wonder what this is. It certainly meets the challenge.</td>', 'I wonder what this is. It certainly meets the challenge.', '2008-04-11 12:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
