(4634597, 666403, 59415, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the bottom leg being cut out of the bottom of the frame.  Other than that it is a very nice image.</td>', 'I don''t like the bottom leg being cut out of the bottom of the frame.  Other than that it is a very nice image.', '2008-04-12 03:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
