(4634991, 667341, 19799, '<td valign="top">The square crop takes away from the shot IMHO. I would like to see more of the feeder and entire bird. This may have taken the shot out of the running for the theme of the challenge though, which I understand.</td>', 'The square crop takes away from the shot IMHO. I would like to see more of the feeder and entire bird. This may have taken the shot out of the running for the theme of the challenge though, which I understand.', '2008-04-12 12:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4634997, 666123, 19799, '<td valign="top">This shot really works in the centered composition. Nice job!</td>', 'This shot really works in the centered composition. Nice job!', '2008-04-12 12:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635004, 666774, 19799, '<td valign="top">Great detail and sharpness.</td>', 'Great detail and sharpness.', '2008-04-12 12:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635006, 665712, 19799, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the bridge but having a car or a runner or something on the road would give it more appeal.</td>', 'Great capture of the bridge but having a car or a runner or something on the road would give it more appeal.', '2008-04-12 12:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635008, 666700, 19799, '<td valign="top">Not sure the center crop is the answer to this shot. I see it as more a tight landscape crop.</td>', 'Not sure the center crop is the answer to this shot. I see it as more a tight landscape crop.', '2008-04-12 12:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635010, 665482, 19799, '<td valign="top">Fun capture and very well exposed.</td>', 'Fun capture and very well exposed.', '2008-04-12 12:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635129, 666835, 60173, '<td valign="top">I love the complimenting colors and how they''re layered. I wish I could see more of what she were doing. I associate that position with cell phone texting, heh. <br/> <br/>I think the photo as a whole is just a tad over-sharpened. I''d imagine you were trying to get the subject sharper, but with the limitations of Basic, you couldn''t just single her out. The smaller rocks along the shore look a bit busy and pixelated with the sharpening. It might also be caused by the compression to JPG.<br/> <br/>The centered composition certainly works for this photo.</td>', 'I love the complimenting colors and how they''re layered. I wish I could see more of what she were doing. I associate that position with cell phone texting, heh.  I think the photo as a whole is just a tad over-sharpened. I''d imagine you were trying to get the subject sharper, but with the limitations of Basic, you couldn''t just single her out. The smaller rocks along the shore look a bit busy and pixelated with the sharpening. It might also be caused by the compression to JPG. The centered composition certainly works for this photo.', '2008-04-12 15:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635135, 665490, 60173, '<td valign="top">Ahh!<br/> <br/>A more interesting background would help this photo significantly. If you''re going to have your background in focus it needs to somehow support the image''s message. <br/> <br/>Speaking of message.. what does the shirt say? A t-shirt that the viewer can''t clearly read is distracting.<br/> <br/>I assume this is a self portrait and that''s why one hand is out of focus. It looks like it was a bit too close to the lens. Gotta love the distortion though, heh.</td>', 'Ahh! A more interesting background would help this photo significantly. If you''re going to have your background in focus it needs to somehow support the image''s message.  Speaking of message.. what does the shirt say? A t-shirt that the viewer can''t clearly read is distracting. I assume this is a self portrait and that''s why one hand is out of focus. It looks like it was a bit too close to the lens. Gotta love the distortion though, heh.', '2008-04-12 15:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635142, 665297, 60173, '<td valign="top">Often times centered composition begs for a square crop, and I think this is one of those cases. I think the image would have a lot more power as a square crop. As it is right now the green beams take away from the adorable cat.<br/> <br/>When you have horizontal lines like that, most people will expect them to be straight. Your cat''s eyes appear to be level, so the more you can minimize the green bars, the better it will be.</td>', 'Often times centered composition begs for a square crop, and I think this is one of those cases. I think the image would have a lot more power as a square crop. As it is right now the green beams take away from the adorable cat. When you have horizontal lines like that, most people will expect them to be straight. Your cat''s eyes appear to be level, so the more you can minimize the green bars, the better it will be.', '2008-04-12 15:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635153, 666795, 60173, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice and pleasant to the eye, but there''s nothing terribly interesting about the photo to me. This is not to say that it''s not a nice photo, but it just doesn''t draw any emotional attachment for me.</td>', 'The colors are nice and pleasant to the eye, but there''s nothing terribly interesting about the photo to me. This is not to say that it''s not a nice photo, but it just doesn''t draw any emotional attachment for me.', '2008-04-12 16:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635163, 666963, 60173, '<td valign="top">I''m not sold on the harsh flash/light for this photo. <br/> <br/>I''ve seen some harsh sun, but if I had to guess, I''d say that this is a flash. I''m still learning about flashes, so I don''t know exactly how you could have made this better. With the delicate pastel flowers I would say you usually would want a softer light. Natural light is great for these types of shots with maybe a soft bounced fill flash.</td>', 'I''m not sold on the harsh flash/light for this photo.  I''ve seen some harsh sun, but if I had to guess, I''d say that this is a flash. I''m still learning about flashes, so I don''t know exactly how you could have made this better. With the delicate pastel flowers I would say you usually would want a softer light. Natural light is great for these types of shots with maybe a soft bounced fill flash.', '2008-04-12 16:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635166, 667137, 60173, '<td valign="top">You''ll probably get some "snapshot" comments with this shot. This could use some stronger saturation to bring out the yellows, reds, and maybe some blue from the sky. The whites could use a bit of a Curve boost also.</td>', 'You''ll probably get some "snapshot" comments with this shot. This could use some stronger saturation to bring out the yellows, reds, and maybe some blue from the sky. The whites could use a bit of a Curve boost also.', '2008-04-12 16:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635176, 665633, 60173, '<td valign="top">There''s a great mood going on here, but the building at across from the exit distracts from the man. There''s probably not much you could have done about it in basic other than try to blow the whites out there.</td>', 'There''s a great mood going on here, but the building at across from the exit distracts from the man. There''s probably not much you could have done about it in basic other than try to blow the whites out there.', '2008-04-12 16:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635180, 667274, 60173, '<td valign="top">Love the DOF and colors. Very powerful image. <br/> <br/>Those are some very interesting markings on the cat. Almost looks like a flame above the one eye.</td>', 'Love the DOF and colors. Very powerful image.  Those are some very interesting markings on the cat. Almost looks like a flame above the one eye.', '2008-04-12 16:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635192, 667161, 60173, '<td valign="top">Nice experiment, but not so nice entry into a photo contest. There''s nothing terribly interesting here. I''ve seen shots of push pins that were interesting, but this is pretty much a straight forward shot of a push pin with a tight DOF.<br/> <br/>The colors and focus are nice, though!</td>', 'Nice experiment, but not so nice entry into a photo contest. There''s nothing terribly interesting here. I''ve seen shots of push pins that were interesting, but this is pretty much a straight forward shot of a push pin with a tight DOF. The colors and focus are nice, though!', '2008-04-12 16:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635207, 667009, 60173, '<td valign="top">I think the hat was casting some yellow color on your white background. Playing with Selective Color and Curves helps to eliminate the yellow cast. Once you''ve eliminated that, you can boost the yellow back up in Hue/Saturation. Add back in the Contrast via Brightness/Contrast, and you''re good to go.<br/> <br/>I do have to say something about the fishing net. While it''s a very cute idea, you have to be careful of the perception of fish net on skin, especially where the net is hitting the leg on this kid-o. Before I recognized that it was an actual fish net, I had a quick thought of "why is this baby wearing fish-nets??"<br/> <br/>Also, careful to not cut off cute baby hands!  =)</td>', 'I think the hat was casting some yellow color on your white background. Playing with Selective Color and Curves helps to eliminate the yellow cast. Once you''ve eliminated that, you can boost the yellow back up in Hue/Saturation. Add back in the Contrast via Brightness/Contrast, and you''re good to go. I do have to say something about the fishing net. While it''s a very cute idea, you have to be careful of the perception of fish net on skin, especially where the net is hitting the leg on this kid-o. Before I recognized that it was an actual fish net, I had a quick thought of "why is this baby wearing fish-nets??" Also, careful to not cut off cute baby hands!  =)', '2008-04-12 17:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635214, 666736, 60173, '<td valign="top">There''s nothing I would change about this photo other than the model''s smirk. Looks like one side of her mouth is open more than the other.</td>', 'There''s nothing I would change about this photo other than the model''s smirk. Looks like one side of her mouth is open more than the other.', '2008-04-12 17:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635216, 667363, 60173, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pose and black and white processing.</td>', 'Beautiful pose and black and white processing.', '2008-04-12 17:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635217, 665480, 60173, '<td valign="top">This is a cool idea. It''s one of those situations where you realize just how dirty everything is too though, heh. There''s several dust spots on both the mirror and the glass it''s standing on.<br/> <br/>The image seems like it should have a softness to it, but the black is pretty abrupt. I''m not sure if the black background would have looked better as something much lighter or maybe pull a color from the sunset (like the light blue).</td>', 'This is a cool idea. It''s one of those situations where you realize just how dirty everything is too though, heh. There''s several dust spots on both the mirror and the glass it''s standing on. The image seems like it should have a softness to it, but the black is pretty abrupt. I''m not sure if the black background would have looked better as something much lighter or maybe pull a color from the sunset (like the light blue).', '2008-04-12 17:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635220, 666975, 60173, '<td valign="top">Someone needs to moisturize! It''s funny when you see creatures up close, because you see things you wouldn''t expect. Like eyelashes!<br/> <br/>Your focus and DOF look pretty good. I think I would have liked to see him with his head turned just a little. Those long narrow bird heads can get lost so easily in the background.</td>', 'Someone needs to moisturize! It''s funny when you see creatures up close, because you see things you wouldn''t expect. Like eyelashes! Your focus and DOF look pretty good. I think I would have liked to see him with his head turned just a little. Those long narrow bird heads can get lost so easily in the background.', '2008-04-12 17:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635226, 667163, 60173, '<td valign="top">Sure.. blind warrior, heh. They look so tough with their hoods on, but are so docile and... blind!<br/> <br/>Beautiful gradient sky and backlight off the shiny leather. There''s some weirdness going on with the back tightening straps. I''d be curious what in your processing caused that. There''s some slight banding in your sky, so maybe you pushed your color too far?</td>', 'Sure.. blind warrior, heh. They look so tough with their hoods on, but are so docile and... blind! Beautiful gradient sky and backlight off the shiny leather. There''s some weirdness going on with the back tightening straps. I''d be curious what in your processing caused that. There''s some slight banding in your sky, so maybe you pushed your color too far?', '2008-04-12 17:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635236, 665208, 60173, '<td valign="top">Hey, there''s a very familiar kid-o. <br/> <br/>Lighting and processing are beautiful like usual, but I almost want to see another element to the photo; an action, an object... something. Kinda sucks when people know what you''re capable of, heh. We want more!</td>', 'Hey, there''s a very familiar kid-o.  Lighting and processing are beautiful like usual, but I almost want to see another element to the photo; an action, an object... something. Kinda sucks when people know what you''re capable of, heh. We want more!', '2008-04-12 17:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635242, 666887, 60173, '<td valign="top">This could use a slightly greater DOF to include more of the beak, but this is still a very beautiful image. I love the colors and the detail in the eye.</td>', 'This could use a slightly greater DOF to include more of the beak, but this is still a very beautiful image. I love the colors and the detail in the eye.', '2008-04-12 17:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
