(4635833, 665803, 12661, '<td valign="top">I can easily see this quality inside of a magazine (no pun intended). Good job on avoiding excessive reflections off of the casings.</td>', 'I can easily see this quality inside of a magazine (no pun intended). Good job on avoiding excessive reflections off of the casings.', '2008-04-13 00:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635835, 666536, 92490, '<td valign="top">Definitely the stinker.</td>', 'Definitely the stinker.', '2008-04-13 00:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635836, 666700, 12661, '<td valign="top">Excellent line of sight. I love the way the sun lies perfectly with the tip of the plant. As an afterthough, and a minor one at that, I think this shot may work even better in a portrait orientation.</td>', 'Excellent line of sight. I love the way the sun lies perfectly with the tip of the plant. As an afterthough, and a minor one at that, I think this shot may work even better in a portrait orientation.', '2008-04-13 00:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635837, 667301, 12661, '<td valign="top">Thank you for providing a cat photograph that is well made. The lighting, focus, and composition are perfect. When a cat shows up on my screen, my cursor tends to drift to the left side of the voting scale. You are one of the exceptions.</td>', 'Thank you for providing a cat photograph that is well made. The lighting, focus, and composition are perfect. When a cat shows up on my screen, my cursor tends to drift to the left side of the voting scale. You are one of the exceptions.', '2008-04-13 00:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635842, 667370, 12661, '<td valign="top">I like the way you interpreted the challenge with the subject of the photograph  rather than just the composition. The motion of the wheel plays nicely with the sharpness of the hands and background. All in all, very well done. The only detractions, and minor ones at that, are the bright reflections on the hands.</td>', 'I like the way you interpreted the challenge with the subject of the photograph  rather than just the composition. The motion of the wheel plays nicely with the sharpness of the hands and background. All in all, very well done. The only detractions, and minor ones at that, are the bright reflections on the hands.', '2008-04-13 00:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635844, 666837, 75651, '<td valign="top">Nice photo with good crisp sharpness and interesting composition.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Nice photo with good crisp sharpness and interesting composition.  Nicely done.', '2008-04-13 00:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635845, 666886, 75651, '<td valign="top">Good photo with a nice shallow DOF.  The subject itself is a bit bland but good technical quality to it.</td>', 'Good photo with a nice shallow DOF.  The subject itself is a bit bland but good technical quality to it.', '2008-04-13 00:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635846, 667122, 12661, '<td valign="top">I''m jealous!!!! (May not be helpful, but I had to say it.)</td>', 'I''m jealous!!!! (May not be helpful, but I had to say it.)', '2008-04-13 00:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635847, 667078, 87751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colorl.</td>', 'Beautiful colorl.', '2008-04-13 00:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635849, 667046, 87751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2008-04-13 00:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635850, 666963, 75651, '<td valign="top">Alot going on in this photo making it a bit difficualt to really pick out that single red rose.  There are so many types of different flowers and everything is in focus.  Perhaps to isolate that rose, pulling it more forward and pushing the rest back, then creating a shallow DOF by opening up the aperature, would make you flower really pop out.</td>', 'Alot going on in this photo making it a bit difficualt to really pick out that single red rose.  There are so many types of different flowers and everything is in focus.  Perhaps to isolate that rose, pulling it more forward and pushing the rest back, then creating a shallow DOF by opening up the aperature, would make you flower really pop out.', '2008-04-13 00:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635852, 667298, 75651, '<td valign="top">I love these turtles.  Very good image, I especially like the reflection though it does take the subject out of center while including it in there though.  Nice technical quality to it though.</td>', 'I love these turtles.  Very good image, I especially like the reflection though it does take the subject out of center while including it in there though.  Nice technical quality to it though.', '2008-04-13 00:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635853, 667043, 12661, '<td valign="top">Not to dredge up the old expression, ''A picture is worth a thousand words'', but there is something about this photograph that could inspire a novel. The posture, expression, and sideways glance give a sense of wanning anticipation. It really makes we want to read the story behind it.</td>', 'Not to dredge up the old expression, ''A picture is worth a thousand words'', but there is something about this photograph that could inspire a novel. The posture, expression, and sideways glance give a sense of wanning anticipation. It really makes we want to read the story behind it.', '2008-04-13 00:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635854, 665527, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of snow (not an easy subject to photograph).  The subject it a bit difficult to make out though which leaves the photo a bit bland.  The skyline is phenominal.</td>', 'Very nice capture of snow (not an easy subject to photograph).  The subject it a bit difficult to make out though which leaves the photo a bit bland.  The skyline is phenominal.', '2008-04-13 00:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635855, 665729, 75651, '<td valign="top">Interesting capture, the bird almost looks evil with the food in its mouth.</td>', 'Interesting capture, the bird almost looks evil with the food in its mouth.', '2008-04-13 00:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635857, 666109, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very nice flower with great crisp focus and a certainly centered composition.  The colors really pop- almost too much saturation but it seems to really pull that texture out in the pedals.  Nicely taken.</td>', 'Very nice flower with great crisp focus and a certainly centered composition.  The colors really pop- almost too much saturation but it seems to really pull that texture out in the pedals.  Nicely taken.', '2008-04-13 00:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635859, 666430, 75651, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting plant, the only thing that is distracting is the lighting at the top of the plant.  It pulls my eye there quickly, but there is not much to look at as the center of the subject really seems to be that point in the middle.  focus is tad short but it is decent overall.</td>', 'This is a very interesting plant, the only thing that is distracting is the lighting at the top of the plant.  It pulls my eye there quickly, but there is not much to look at as the center of the subject really seems to be that point in the middle.  focus is tad short but it is decent overall.', '2008-04-13 00:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635861, 665831, 12661, '<td valign="top">Thought #1: Too cluttered<br/>Thought #2: Doesn''t meet challenge<br/>Thought #3: OH!!! I see it now!!! Awesome.<br/> <br/>Certainly a photo that needs to be viewed for a while to be appreciated. Nice catch and good job seeing the image. You certainly have a photographic eye. That is a scene I would have walk right by without thinking twice.</td>', 'Thought #1: Too clutteredThought #2: Doesn''t meet challengeThought #3: OH!!! I see it now!!! Awesome. Certainly a photo that needs to be viewed for a while to be appreciated. Nice catch and good job seeing the image. You certainly have a photographic eye. That is a scene I would have walk right by without thinking twice.', '2008-04-13 00:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635863, 666065, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture with the inch worm.  The falloff of the focus is a bit much on the edges on the bottom and right half.  I would ahve love this image if the lighting was earlier and the shadow that was cast from the inch worm really spread out onto that pedal.  Very good overall though.  Nice find.</td>', 'Very nice capture with the inch worm.  The falloff of the focus is a bit much on the edges on the bottom and right half.  I would ahve love this image if the lighting was earlier and the shadow that was cast from the inch worm really spread out onto that pedal.  Very good overall though.  Nice find.', '2008-04-13 00:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4635864, 667136, 87751, '<td valign="top">Very humorous --- and creative as well.</td>', 'Very humorous --- and creative as well.', '2008-04-13 00:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
