(4635869, 666186, 75651, '<td valign="top">What a great looking butterfly.  Even though this is centered composition, the area around the butterfly is really negative space that doesn''t help the subject all.  You may want to consider a tighter crop even for this competition. Very nice sharpness and colors though.</td>', 'What a great looking butterfly.  Even though this is centered composition, the area around the butterfly is really negative space that doesn''t help the subject all.  You may want to consider a tighter crop even for this competition. Very nice sharpness and colors though.', '2008-04-13 00:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
