(4636135, 666695, 92424, '<td valign="top">This one immediately made me chuckle! Nice shot!  The BG is a bit distracting however, so maybe a closer crop, and if possible a wider aperture would really polish this image.</td>', 'This one immediately made me chuckle! Nice shot!  The BG is a bit distracting however, so maybe a closer crop, and if possible a wider aperture would really polish this image.', '2008-04-13 08:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
