(4636280, 666015, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very nice compoisiton.  When i look at it, it begins to look very surreal. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Very nice compoisiton.  When i look at it, it begins to look very surreal. Very nicely done.', '2008-04-13 11:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636284, 666350, 75651, '<td valign="top">Looks like East Stoudsburg University.  It is good centered composition with some good guiding lines.  It is lacking a bit of intrigue though which makes it very bland.  Overall- very good technical quality to it. good job.</td>', 'Looks like East Stoudsburg University.  It is good centered composition with some good guiding lines.  It is lacking a bit of intrigue though which makes it very bland.  Overall- very good technical quality to it. good job.', '2008-04-13 11:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4636286, 666383, 75651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shallow DOF.  The problem with such a shallow DOF, is that the in focus part of the subject really has to hold the attention of the viewer long enough to view all parts of the photo and I think this does so very well.  Very nice job.</td>', 'Beautiful shallow DOF.  The problem with such a shallow DOF, is that the in focus part of the subject really has to hold the attention of the viewer long enough to view all parts of the photo and I think this does so very well.  Very nice job.', '2008-04-13 11:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
