(4638637, 667365, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump: Glad I had the time to come back and revisit this entry.  Nicely arranged and the post processing is well done.  A tad more light on the main subject would have pushed this into the 9-10 range for me.  As is, a very well deserved 7.</td>', 'Back to comment and bump: Glad I had the time to come back and revisit this entry.  Nicely arranged and the post processing is well done.  A tad more light on the main subject would have pushed this into the 9-10 range for me.  As is, a very well deserved 7.', '2008-04-14 13:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
