(4638976, 665961, 5364, '<td valign="top">Assuming the taps are chromed, you could have done with adjusting the white balance so they look like silver. If they actually yellow, then disregard what I have written!</td>', 'Assuming the taps are chromed, you could have done with adjusting the white balance so they look like silver. If they actually yellow, then disregard what I have written!', '2008-04-14 16:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
