(4640586, 665764, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like this is a lot. It is very evocative - it makes me think of the famous photos of Auschwitz, though perhaps that was not your intent.</td>', 'I like this is a lot. It is very evocative - it makes me think of the famous photos of Auschwitz, though perhaps that was not your intent.', '2008-04-15 11:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
