(4640589, 666428, 66597, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, but I must say the hair on the armpits is a bit distracting. I also don''t think the hat adds anything to it. Otherwise, has a bit of a Man Ray look (i.e. famous photo of woman as Minotaur).</td>', 'I like this a lot, but I must say the hair on the armpits is a bit distracting. I also don''t think the hat adds anything to it. Otherwise, has a bit of a Man Ray look (i.e. famous photo of woman as Minotaur).', '2008-04-15 11:07:03.000000', NULL, 1);
