(4640597, 667413, 66597, '<td valign="top">Interesting intentional abstract, but this one doesn''t really work for me. However, maybe it will work for others. Maybe it is too bright and I''m having trouble understanding the concept?</td>', 'Interesting intentional abstract, but this one doesn''t really work for me. However, maybe it will work for others. Maybe it is too bright and I''m having trouble understanding the concept?', '2008-04-15 11:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
