(4641194, 666044, 5364, '<td valign="top">Could you have composed this without the tree in the background? Because it intrudes rather.</td>', 'Could you have composed this without the tree in the background? Because it intrudes rather.', '2008-04-15 16:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641252, 666670, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very nice flower shape.  The focus is a bit soft though.  but overall not bad.</td>', 'Very nice flower shape.  The focus is a bit soft though.  but overall not bad.', '2008-04-15 17:27:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641254, 667394, 75651, '<td valign="top">You certainly have the subject centered but there are quite a few things you may want to look at as far as technical quality goes.  Most importantly, the image is very very grainy and the subject itself seems rather bland.  I think if you had more to it to tell a bigger story it might help some.</td>', 'You certainly have the subject centered but there are quite a few things you may want to look at as far as technical quality goes.  Most importantly, the image is very very grainy and the subject itself seems rather bland.  I think if you had more to it to tell a bigger story it might help some.', '2008-04-15 17:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641258, 665770, 75651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Horse and great angle onthat horse though the focus does seem a bit soft.  Nice job none-the-less.</td>', 'Beautiful Horse and great angle onthat horse though the focus does seem a bit soft.  Nice job none-the-less.', '2008-04-15 17:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641259, 667229, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very soft focus but love that out of focus background.  Perhaps a stop or two on the aperature would have been enough.</td>', 'Very soft focus but love that out of focus background.  Perhaps a stop or two on the aperature would have been enough.', '2008-04-15 17:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641261, 666217, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very nicely centered compoisition and good focus on the tassel.  Nice job.</td>', 'Very nicely centered compoisition and good focus on the tassel.  Nice job.', '2008-04-15 17:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641262, 665297, 75651, '<td valign="top">Nice lines and focus.  great subject too.  FYI-The horizon lines are bit tilted.</td>', 'Nice lines and focus.  great subject too.  FYI-The horizon lines are bit tilted.', '2008-04-15 17:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641263, 667142, 75651, '<td valign="top">Beautiful ship with wonderful colors.  nice photo.</td>', 'Beautiful ship with wonderful colors.  nice photo.', '2008-04-15 17:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641264, 665411, 75651, '<td valign="top">The subject being dark, is hard to automatically respond to it as my eye keeps getting pulled to that very bright and in focus background.  Very interesting framing with the wall though.  Overall I think it is a wonderful concept that could use a few iomprovements to make it great.</td>', 'The subject being dark, is hard to automatically respond to it as my eye keeps getting pulled to that very bright and in focus background.  Very interesting framing with the wall though.  Overall I think it is a wonderful concept that could use a few iomprovements to make it great.', '2008-04-15 17:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641266, 667119, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject with the plant in the bowl.  Makes some very nice lines.</td>', 'Very interesting subject with the plant in the bowl.  Makes some very nice lines.', '2008-04-15 17:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641268, 666998, 75651, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice find though the focus of the leaf along that plane almost make the photo to complex with where the eye is pulled.  Even though its centered, don''t be afraid to crop iot even more if you can.</td>', 'This is a very nice find though the focus of the leaf along that plane almost make the photo to complex with where the eye is pulled.  Even though its centered, don''t be afraid to crop iot even more if you can.', '2008-04-15 17:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641273, 666544, 75651, '<td valign="top">It is a very nice and interesting centered piece- though seeing the photographer in the reflection doesn''t really do anything for me.  It''s more like a friendly photo rather than a competition photo.  Still I like the concept alot.</td>', 'It is a very nice and interesting centered piece- though seeing the photographer in the reflection doesn''t really do anything for me.  It''s more like a friendly photo rather than a competition photo.  Still I like the concept alot.', '2008-04-15 17:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641278, 665765, 75651, '<td valign="top">Nice almost independant film-ish/photojournalistic appeal if you will.  Watch that focus though.</td>', 'Nice almost independant film-ish/photojournalistic appeal if you will.  Watch that focus though.', '2008-04-15 17:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641281, 667028, 75651, '<td valign="top">Awesome story you have here.  Great composition.  I really like this one.</td>', 'Awesome story you have here.  Great composition.  I really like this one.', '2008-04-15 17:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641285, 666090, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very nice lines and centering.  See- keeping your head up in the clouds can be a good thing.  :)</td>', 'Very nice lines and centering.  See- keeping your head up in the clouds can be a good thing.  :)', '2008-04-15 17:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641288, 666047, 75651, '<td valign="top">Not sure I agree with the concept of pointing any gun at anyone, even empty.  But since you did- it might be a bit more dramitic if the site was lined up with his eye and you cropped it in just a bit more.  I am curious though- did you want the gun out of focus?  I think if someone had a gun to there head- the would look at the gun- not the person.  IMO</td>', 'Not sure I agree with the concept of pointing any gun at anyone, even empty.  But since you did- it might be a bit more dramitic if the site was lined up with his eye and you cropped it in just a bit more.  I am curious though- did you want the gun out of focus?  I think if someone had a gun to there head- the would look at the gun- not the person.  IMO', '2008-04-15 17:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641291, 665812, 75651, '<td valign="top">BEautiful building- looks like a sail on a sailboat. Really could have used some clouds for depth but hey- you take what''s given!!  Nice.</td>', 'BEautiful building- looks like a sail on a sailboat. Really could have used some clouds for depth but hey- you take what''s given!!  Nice.', '2008-04-15 17:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641293, 666952, 75651, '<td valign="top">Thats gotta be a bit tough to get that photo unless you propped everything up.  I''m sure people will tell you to focus that target in the middle better which is very true, even if it was nearly impossible.  Nice subject and concept.</td>', 'Thats gotta be a bit tough to get that photo unless you propped everything up.  I''m sure people will tell you to focus that target in the middle better which is very true, even if it was nearly impossible.  Nice subject and concept.', '2008-04-15 17:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641296, 667193, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and focus.  It is rather tough to make out what is at the end, but still very interesting photo.</td>', 'Very nice composition and focus.  It is rather tough to make out what is at the end, but still very interesting photo.', '2008-04-15 17:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641301, 665336, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very nice conceptual photograph.  Perhaps some different lighting, a bit harsher to really play up the mood would have helped tremendously.  Very nice story though.</td>', 'Very nice conceptual photograph.  Perhaps some different lighting, a bit harsher to really play up the mood would have helped tremendously.  Very nice story though.', '2008-04-15 17:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641306, 666173, 75651, '<td valign="top">I think this is just too complex with no sense of flow to really be eye appealing.  Which is unfortunate, because your creativity is spot on!!  PErhaps just a single snow covered pedal could have simplified it a bit.  Try just one flower and see for yourself.</td>', 'I think this is just too complex with no sense of flow to really be eye appealing.  Which is unfortunate, because your creativity is spot on!!  PErhaps just a single snow covered pedal could have simplified it a bit.  Try just one flower and see for yourself.', '2008-04-15 17:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641307, 667068, 75651, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Simple, great lines, great flow...great... great scott I''m gettin'' dizzy.  WOndeful job. an easy ten for me.</td>', 'Awesome. Simple, great lines, great flow...great... great scott I''m gettin'' dizzy.  WOndeful job. an easy ten for me.', '2008-04-15 17:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641314, 665973, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  Really don''t like that yellow lined merger through his head though.  Alos- rule of thumb- always leave room for movement.  Right now, when the pitcher finishes his step, he will be out of the photo with that foot.  Leave room to breathe in this case.</td>', 'Very nice capture.  Really don''t like that yellow lined merger through his head though.  Alos- rule of thumb- always leave room for movement.  Right now, when the pitcher finishes his step, he will be out of the photo with that foot.  Leave room to breathe in this case.', '2008-04-15 17:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641315, 665711, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very good focus and very simple.  Not much creativity or originality but hey- we''re centered and focused- what more could you ask for.  Nice photo.</td>', 'Very good focus and very simple.  Not much creativity or originality but hey- we''re centered and focused- what more could you ask for.  Nice photo.', '2008-04-15 17:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641318, 665742, 75651, '<td valign="top">The lighting REALLY hurts- the Concept is fabulous.</td>', 'The lighting REALLY hurts- the Concept is fabulous.', '2008-04-15 17:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641321, 666706, 75651, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  The reflection of the light in the one lens is ratehr distracting as well as the falloff of the focus.  Interesting and simple idea though.</td>', 'Very interesting.  The reflection of the light in the one lens is ratehr distracting as well as the falloff of the focus.  Interesting and simple idea though.', '2008-04-15 17:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641323, 666885, 75651, '<td valign="top">Wonderful architecture.  Perhaps an earlier or later time of day and those shadows on the pillar would make it look almost 3D</td>', 'Wonderful architecture.  Perhaps an earlier or later time of day and those shadows on the pillar would make it look almost 3D', '2008-04-15 17:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641324, 667254, 75651, '<td valign="top">The flower is nice.  Remember to get all that flower in the shot and to really try and cut out the clutter (complexity) around it.  Flowers are a great place to practice though.</td>', 'The flower is nice.  Remember to get all that flower in the shot and to really try and cut out the clutter (complexity) around it.  Flowers are a great place to practice though.', '2008-04-15 18:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641327, 666151, 75651, '<td valign="top">Awesom framing with that tree.  Looks like torn paper.  Definite points for that.  That branch on the right (though some may disagree) actually adds to that ripped paper feel I get.  This is one of the most intersting yet simpliest compositions I''ve seen yet in the category.  VERY nice work.</td>', 'Awesom framing with that tree.  Looks like torn paper.  Definite points for that.  That branch on the right (though some may disagree) actually adds to that ripped paper feel I get.  This is one of the most intersting yet simpliest compositions I''ve seen yet in the category.  VERY nice work.', '2008-04-15 18:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641328, 667155, 75651, '<td valign="top">Always shoot with morning or evening light on open water.  The lighthouse is nice, but the surrounding area isn''t all that interesting.  Try to get up close to that one and really pull a feature out of it.</td>', 'Always shoot with morning or evening light on open water.  The lighthouse is nice, but the surrounding area isn''t all that interesting.  Try to get up close to that one and really pull a feature out of it.', '2008-04-15 18:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641330, 665993, 75651, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  Great timing.</td>', 'Nice capture.  Great timing.', '2008-04-15 18:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641332, 666237, 75651, '<td valign="top">Good shallow focus.  The subject is lacking more interest though.  More of a parent snapshot for the album.</td>', 'Good shallow focus.  The subject is lacking more interest though.  More of a parent snapshot for the album.', '2008-04-15 18:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641336, 666602, 75651, '<td valign="top">BEAutiful.  That''s all- just beautiful</td>', 'BEAutiful.  That''s all- just beautiful', '2008-04-15 18:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
