(4641374, 666440, 75651, '<td valign="top">Great focus and subject.  I feel like the horizon line should be fixed,</td>', 'Great focus and subject.  I feel like the horizon line should be fixed,', '2008-04-15 18:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641403, 667046, 77521, '<td valign="top">id give this a 15 if it was allowed. love the colors and everything in this is PERFECT..</td>', 'id give this a 15 if it was allowed. love the colors and everything in this is PERFECT..', '2008-04-15 18:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641478, 665989, 60698, '<td valign="top">The Marble Master is at it again with her trusty macro lens and a bag of marbles. The detail and is superb and I love the blues and greens. Looks so lush and cool! It just draws you in to linger a while in this little marble world!</td>', 'The Marble Master is at it again with her trusty macro lens and a bag of marbles. The detail and is superb and I love the blues and greens. Looks so lush and cool! It just draws you in to linger a while in this little marble world!', '2008-04-15 19:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641645, 667334, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m sure she appreciates the exposure to the leering DPC crowds.</td>', 'I''m sure she appreciates the exposure to the leering DPC crowds.', '2008-04-15 21:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641647, 666710, 83313, '<td valign="top">I was never quite sure how that was spelled. Thank you. A very cute snapshot, but a snapshot.</td>', 'I was never quite sure how that was spelled. Thank you. A very cute snapshot, but a snapshot.', '2008-04-15 21:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641650, 665970, 33672, '<td valign="top">I''ll admit I gave this a low score. I''ve never been a fan of photos of artwork (Popular, ordinary or otherwise) that don''t use lighting/shadows or POV to add something. The noise detracts too. You do, however meet the theme perfectly. Just one person''s opinion. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''ll admit I gave this a low score. I''ve never been a fan of photos of artwork (Popular, ordinary or otherwise) that don''t use lighting/shadows or POV to add something. The noise detracts too. You do, however meet the theme perfectly. Just one person''s opinion. Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-04-15 21:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641652, 667177, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice bold colors on the water. The whole thing is nice and straight for the angle it was taken at. I''m guessing the photog here is Ben H., as this subject looks familiar. Of course, it could be someone else visiting a popular location.</td>', 'Nice bold colors on the water. The whole thing is nice and straight for the angle it was taken at. I''m guessing the photog here is Ben H., as this subject looks familiar. Of course, it could be someone else visiting a popular location.', '2008-04-15 22:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641653, 665973, 33672, '<td valign="top">I think the POV on this detracts from an otherwise well done photo. It meets the theme and I like the slight blur that lets me see the action behind the pitcher. The main subject is nice and sharp but the yellow line across his shoulders takes away from it all.</td>', 'I think the POV on this detracts from an otherwise well done photo. It meets the theme and I like the slight blur that lets me see the action behind the pitcher. The main subject is nice and sharp but the yellow line across his shoulders takes away from it all.', '2008-04-15 22:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641655, 666963, 33672, '<td valign="top">This seems a  bit over exposed. Perhaps the use of a polarizer (either a filter or in PP) would help.</td>', 'This seems a  bit over exposed. Perhaps the use of a polarizer (either a filter or in PP) would help.', '2008-04-15 22:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641660, 665738, 33672, '<td valign="top">I like the comp and the contrast. However a different POV (IMO)that would let me see more of the bird''s upper portion would suit me better.</td>', 'I like the comp and the contrast. However a different POV (IMO)that would let me see more of the bird''s upper portion would suit me better.', '2008-04-15 22:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641661, 667376, 33672, '<td valign="top">Comp, shapes and lines are nice. Needs a levels adjustment or something to really give it some more "pop".</td>', 'Comp, shapes and lines are nice. Needs a levels adjustment or something to really give it some more "pop".', '2008-04-15 22:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641662, 666780, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think you may have lost some detail to JPEG compression. A file size of only 49k confirms it. Check your compression settings when you save.</td>', 'I think you may have lost some detail to JPEG compression. A file size of only 49k confirms it. Check your compression settings when you save.', '2008-04-15 22:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641663, 666308, 83313, '<td valign="top">Cute pooch, but just a snapshot, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Cute pooch, but just a snapshot, I''m afraid.', '2008-04-15 22:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641665, 667223, 83313, '<td valign="top">A wideangle landscape with swoopy clouds. How can ya'' go wrong?</td>', 'A wideangle landscape with swoopy clouds. How can ya'' go wrong?', '2008-04-15 22:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641672, 667350, 83313, '<td valign="top">Neat looking. Bold and sharp.</td>', 'Neat looking. Bold and sharp.', '2008-04-15 22:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641673, 667243, 83313, '<td valign="top">Does your companion have a name?</td>', 'Does your companion have a name?', '2008-04-15 22:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641676, 665633, 83313, '<td valign="top">Needs a slight amount of skew correction, but otherwise I like this.</td>', 'Needs a slight amount of skew correction, but otherwise I like this.', '2008-04-15 22:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641677, 667182, 83313, '<td valign="top">A bit of distortion, but this has an appeal for reasons I dont know.</td>', 'A bit of distortion, but this has an appeal for reasons I dont know.', '2008-04-15 22:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641679, 667046, 88054, '<td valign="top">Another beautiful shot.</td>', 'Another beautiful shot.', '2008-04-15 22:20:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641682, 667339, 83313, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite consider this centered comp. Even though the joint of the leaves is in the center, it does not lead the eye there. But, I can see your interpretation of the topic and I do really like it.</td>', 'I don''t quite consider this centered comp. Even though the joint of the leaves is in the center, it does not lead the eye there. But, I can see your interpretation of the topic and I do really like it.', '2008-04-15 22:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641687, 666366, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems to have a visible amount of pixelation. Could be because of so much detail into 640 pixels, and lots of compression was needed..</td>', 'Seems to have a visible amount of pixelation. Could be because of so much detail into 640 pixels, and lots of compression was needed..', '2008-04-15 22:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641691, 667237, 83313, '<td valign="top">Didn''t know ducks were uncommon there.</td>', 'Didn''t know ducks were uncommon there.', '2008-04-15 22:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641696, 666262, 88054, '<td valign="top">Intimidating. Too bad the drop is not in the very center of the photo. Still very nicely done. Good luck.</td>', 'Intimidating. Too bad the drop is not in the very center of the photo. Still very nicely done. Good luck.', '2008-04-15 22:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641697, 665867, 83313, '<td valign="top">It''s lizard week!!! (I shot a bunch of lizards late last week and declared it to be lizard week.)</td>', 'It''s lizard week!!! (I shot a bunch of lizards late last week and declared it to be lizard week.)', '2008-04-15 22:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641699, 665463, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seeing lots of these on the shores of the trinity right now.</td>', 'Seeing lots of these on the shores of the trinity right now.', '2008-04-15 22:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641703, 665297, 83313, '<td valign="top">How cute!</td>', 'How cute!', '2008-04-15 22:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641709, 667051, 88054, '<td valign="top">Great idea. The shadows on the bird are a bit too overwhelming. They take away from the textures of the plumage. Almost looks like a silhouette. Too bad you couldn''t run under him with a big reflector disk to add some light to the underside.</td>', 'Great idea. The shadows on the bird are a bit too overwhelming. They take away from the textures of the plumage. Almost looks like a silhouette. Too bad you couldn''t run under him with a big reflector disk to add some light to the underside.', '2008-04-15 22:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641712, 667252, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not big into floral shots, but this blown out, high key yellow is really nice. The whole thing just works. I almost blew by it quickly, but the more I look at it, the more I like it.</td>', 'I''m not big into floral shots, but this blown out, high key yellow is really nice. The whole thing just works. I almost blew by it quickly, but the more I look at it, the more I like it.', '2008-04-15 22:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641718, 666723, 83313, '<td valign="top">Bare trees seem to be tough to make look good. I''ll be this whole scene just pops once the trees are green. Still a worthy effort.</td>', 'Bare trees seem to be tough to make look good. I''ll be this whole scene just pops once the trees are green. Still a worthy effort.', '2008-04-15 22:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641719, 667165, 88054, '<td valign="top">Looks like you were flying with them. The composition and cropping seem a bit off center.</td>', 'Looks like you were flying with them. The composition and cropping seem a bit off center.', '2008-04-15 22:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641720, 666882, 7778, '<td valign="top">Energy/Range/Story: 6/6/6 <br/>Composition/perspective/manner: 6/6/6 <br/>Aesthetics/Technical:6/6 <br/>Presentation: 6 <br/>Total:6 <br/>Vote: 6 <br/> <br/>Remarks: The image appears a little dark (viewed on two monitors) with the white wall perfectly exposed and most of the shadows blocked. This exposure turns the background into an effective mockup, providing a perfect stage for anything in front of it. The silhouetted railing against the reflected light adds a particularly delicious minutiae to the illusion. The long lamp shadow connecting fore and middle, with a little imagination, is pushing the slumped figure centre stage, as if by a crane.<br/> <br/>A well seen and, certainly, a <i>made</i> photograph contrasting the human element against its stenciled tabloid environment.</td>', 'Energy/Range/Story: 6/6/6 Composition/perspective/manner: 6/6/6 Aesthetics/Technical:6/6 Presentation: 6 Total:6 Vote: 6  Remarks: The image appears a little dark (viewed on two monitors) with the white wall perfectly exposed and most of the shadows blocked. This exposure turns the background into an effective mockup, providing a perfect stage for anything in front of it. The silhouetted railing against the reflected light adds a particularly delicious minutiae to the illusion. The long lamp shadow connecting fore and middle, with a little imagination, is pushing the slumped figure centre stage, as if by a crane. A well seen and, certainly, a made photograph contrasting the human element against its stenciled tabloid environment.', '2008-04-15 22:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641733, 667065, 92578, '<td valign="top">Great to have an image that follows rule of thirds and still brings the eyes back to center.</td>', 'Great to have an image that follows rule of thirds and still brings the eyes back to center.', '2008-04-15 22:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641740, 667134, 92578, '<td valign="top">I find my eyes wandering a bit in the image to the body and leg of the frog, then back to the eyes. Usually you don''t want a completely centered composition. I like it, but for the challenge it slides off-center.</td>', 'I find my eyes wandering a bit in the image to the body and leg of the frog, then back to the eyes. Usually you don''t want a completely centered composition. I like it, but for the challenge it slides off-center.', '2008-04-15 22:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641743, 666604, 92578, '<td valign="top">Had to pause and take a closer look. Way more interesting (unless you happen to be an entomologist) not seeing the entire insect.</td>', 'Had to pause and take a closer look. Way more interesting (unless you happen to be an entomologist) not seeing the entire insect.', '2008-04-15 22:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641744, 666837, 92578, '<td valign="top">Despite the precarious position and motion, it still feels right centered.</td>', 'Despite the precarious position and motion, it still feels right centered.', '2008-04-15 22:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641747, 666961, 92578, '<td valign="top">Makes me twitch just thinking about shooting weddings. . .</td>', 'Makes me twitch just thinking about shooting weddings. . .', '2008-04-15 22:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641750, 667370, 92578, '<td valign="top">Good call on the shutter speed. Motion and still. I like it.</td>', 'Good call on the shutter speed. Motion and still. I like it.', '2008-04-15 22:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641754, 666732, 92578, '<td valign="top">I like the texture. Now I''m hungry. . .</td>', 'I like the texture. Now I''m hungry. . .', '2008-04-15 22:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641755, 667079, 92578, '<td valign="top">Manages to follow an asymetrical form while the eyes still find center. Well done.</td>', 'Manages to follow an asymetrical form while the eyes still find center. Well done.', '2008-04-15 22:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4641756, 666599, 92578, '<td valign="top">Feels good with the ground plane and sky, yet centers the attention. Well done.</td>', 'Feels good with the ground plane and sky, yet centers the attention. Well done.', '2008-04-15 22:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
