(4641921, 667196, 75651, '<td valign="top">Flowers are great to learn on but when submitting into a challenge a this stage , they really need to be beyond perfect.  The lighting is bit bland and the focus is falling off a bit on the top portion.</td>', 'Flowers are great to learn on but when submitting into a challenge a this stage , they really need to be beyond perfect.  The lighting is bit bland and the focus is falling off a bit on the top portion.', '2008-04-16 00:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
