(4641957, 666789, 75651, '<td valign="top">ummm...  yup-  this is perfect.10 clean crisp and centered.  Intriguing, colorful and focused...  PEREFECT.  Good Luck</td>', 'ummm...  yup-  this is perfect.10 clean crisp and centered.  Intriguing, colorful and focused...  PEREFECT.  Good Luck', '2008-04-16 00:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
