(4643341, 667114, 49804, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot Jeff, congrats on the good score as well, great tones and I like the centered composition, nicely done.</td>', 'Very nice shot Jeff, congrats on the good score as well, great tones and I like the centered composition, nicely done.', '2008-04-16 10:19:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4643344, 667245, 83395, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all of you out there in DPC world who voted.  I''ve been playing around with submitting photos to this site since last fall.  I''ve put a few out there that haven''t done well.  One of my best friends goes by the user name timfythetoo.  <br/> <br/>I feel good about this shot since I took lots of shots of snakes at the reptile house at the Columbus zoo.  My wife was starting to get impatient that I took a shot of every snake in the building.  I set the timer so that my hand wouldn''t shake as much and tried to press against the glass with my shoulder.  Ultimately, I am pretty pleased with it.  But I also thank Tim for directing me to GIMP because my trial of PE 6 ended.   <br/> <br/>As far as editing...  I didn''t do a whole lot because the pic turned out nice, but adjusted hue and saturation.  I increased the shadows and decreased the highlights.  Tweaked the contrast.  Then, I did a heavy sharpen, probably too much.</td>', 'Thanks to all of you out there in DPC world who voted.  I''ve been playing around with submitting photos to this site since last fall.  I''ve put a few out there that haven''t done well.  One of my best friends goes by the user name timfythetoo.   I feel good about this shot since I took lots of shots of snakes at the reptile house at the Columbus zoo.  My wife was starting to get impatient that I took a shot of every snake in the building.  I set the timer so that my hand wouldn''t shake as much and tried to press against the glass with my shoulder.  Ultimately, I am pretty pleased with it.  But I also thank Tim for directing me to GIMP because my trial of PE 6 ended.    As far as editing...  I didn''t do a whole lot because the pic turned out nice, but adjusted hue and saturation.  I increased the shadows and decreased the highlights.  Tweaked the contrast.  Then, I did a heavy sharpen, probably too much.', '2008-04-16 10:21:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4643345, 667373, 51269, '<td valign="top">One of my faves- congrats !</td>', 'One of my faves- congrats !', '2008-04-16 10:21:05.000000', NULL, 0),
