(4646791, 667246, 68504, '<td valign="top">Appreciate all your comments.  I''d like to add that this photo kind of made itself.  Yes, I was careful to photograph against a plain background, bending and contorting and trying not to step on any other plants, and it was the right time of day - late afternoon, but I really wasn''t thinking too much about it.  I wasn''t trying FOR anything, just seeing what might be seen in it.  When it got to this stage in the processing/playing something said Yes, but I don''t think it was me.</td>', 'Appreciate all your comments.  I''d like to add that this photo kind of made itself.  Yes, I was careful to photograph against a plain background, bending and contorting and trying not to step on any other plants, and it was the right time of day - late afternoon, but I really wasn''t thinking too much about it.  I wasn''t trying FOR anything, just seeing what might be seen in it.  When it got to this stage in the processing/playing something said Yes, but I don''t think it was me.', '2008-04-18 04:19:08.000000', NULL, 0),
