(4648577, 667375, 55838, '<td valign="top">Welcome to DPC!  A decent idea with a good title.  Brightening the shot a bit and bumping up to 150k as Yospiff mentioned below would have taken this shot up into the 5''s in my opinion. DPC is a fun place to play and learn.  Don''t let the 4 scores get ya down.  It won''t be long and you''ll be scoring higher!</td>', 'Welcome to DPC!  A decent idea with a good title.  Brightening the shot a bit and bumping up to 150k as Yospiff mentioned below would have taken this shot up into the 5''s in my opinion. DPC is a fun place to play and learn.  Don''t let the 4 scores get ya down.  It won''t be long and you''ll be scoring higher!', '2008-04-19 10:47:27.000000', NULL, 0),
