(4651193, 666296, 68035, '<td valign="top">Barbara, what a great image.  Fantastic capture of your subject and I love the way that you have done the B&amp;W conversion so that the image does not lose any of its sharpness but still has a soft textured kitten fur quality to it</td>', 'Barbara, what a great image.  Fantastic capture of your subject and I love the way that you have done the B&W conversion so that the image does not lose any of its sharpness but still has a soft textured kitten fur quality to it', '2008-04-21 09:32:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4651198, 667402, 68035, '<td valign="top">Sigh, I guess next time I am compaining about my score I should look at this image and I will realise that great photos dont always get the score that they deserve.  This to me is at least a 6.  I love the sharpness of the leaf and the way it seems almost magically suspended on the spiders web.  Love the imposition of the brown on the green as well</td>', 'Sigh, I guess next time I am compaining about my score I should look at this image and I will realise that great photos dont always get the score that they deserve.  This to me is at least a 6.  I love the sharpness of the leaf and the way it seems almost magically suspended on the spiders web.  Love the imposition of the brown on the green as well', '2008-04-21 09:37:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4651221, 666661, 68035, '<td valign="top">Wow, minimalism and complexity combined to wonderful effect.  I love both the natural luminescence of this image and the deep tonal richness of the pot.<br/> <br/>Sadly, the other thing that impresses me is how you get to take such great images and still have time to have a dust free table!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow, minimalism and complexity combined to wonderful effect.  I love both the natural luminescence of this image and the deep tonal richness of the pot. Sadly, the other thing that impresses me is how you get to take such great images and still have time to have a dust free table! ', '2008-04-21 09:43:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4651237, 667409, 68035, '<td valign="top">Sigh, I really like the perspective on the shot, which does almost make you feel as if you are looking at you and the horse from underground.  The other thing is that yep it is perfectly centred which I kind thought would have been a pre-requisite for a centred challenge but having seen some of the images that ''beat'' you obviously wasnt<br/> <br/>On the colouring, I''d just say that one person''s washed out is another persons gentle pastels and I thought it worked well for the image</td>', 'Sigh, I really like the perspective on the shot, which does almost make you feel as if you are looking at you and the horse from underground.  The other thing is that yep it is perfectly centred which I kind thought would have been a pre-requisite for a centred challenge but having seen some of the images that ''beat'' you obviously wasnt On the colouring, I''d just say that one person''s washed out is another persons gentle pastels and I thought it worked well for the image', '2008-04-21 09:47:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4651243, 667339, 68035, '<td valign="top">Great abstract and I love the dof you have used which has given gentle forground bokeh and really strong background bokeh with, sandwiched in between the very strong tones and sharpness of the leaf<br/> <br/>I thought the border worked really well on this shot</td>', 'Great abstract and I love the dof you have used which has given gentle forground bokeh and really strong background bokeh with, sandwiched in between the very strong tones and sharpness of the leaf I thought the border worked really well on this shot', '2008-04-21 09:50:13.000000', NULL, 0),
