(4655190, 666353, 45790, '<td valign="top">It may be the close crop or the angle, but I can''t get away from seeing this as two pictures photoshopped together. The mother and son don''t appear to be together but the mother looks pasted onto a picture of the son. Dark shots are also risky since many people don''t have calibrated monitors and may not be seeing the low levels.</td>', 'It may be the close crop or the angle, but I can''t get away from seeing this as two pictures photoshopped together. The mother and son don''t appear to be together but the mother looks pasted onto a picture of the son. Dark shots are also risky since many people don''t have calibrated monitors and may not be seeing the low levels.', '2008-04-23 11:09:50.000000', NULL, 0),
