(4664872, 666396, 87808, '<td valign="top">Shame about it not quite being sharp enough.  It is a lovely shot.  The way that the green is behind it really makes it pop out.  The title is brilliant and made me chuckle, as reflected in the voting scores, you can tell this would have placed higher if it had been sharper.  You have a good eye!</td>', 'Shame about it not quite being sharp enough.  It is a lovely shot.  The way that the green is behind it really makes it pop out.  The title is brilliant and made me chuckle, as reflected in the voting scores, you can tell this would have placed higher if it had been sharper.  You have a good eye!', '2008-04-29 12:13:09.000000', NULL, 0),
