(4704193, 666296, 811, '<td valign="top">I''m surprised this didn''t score higher.  Maybe it was cat haters voting?  The lighting and composition are great and I like the cat''s expression -- it looks like it is about to pounce</td>', 'I''m surprised this didn''t score higher.  Maybe it was cat haters voting?  The lighting and composition are great and I like the cat''s expression -- it looks like it is about to pounce', '2008-05-15 11:45:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(4708303, 665270, 38930, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why this scored so low - it''s a great picture!</td>', 'I don''t know why this scored so low - it''s a great picture!', '2008-05-17 12:11:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4722309, 667043, 21569, '<td valign="top">The shot looks a bit fuzzy to be. Camera shake?</td>', 'The shot looks a bit fuzzy to be. Camera shake?', '2008-05-25 07:20:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(4726615, 667294, 45475, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... not exactly stretching any skills by taking a straight photo of a statue. Try a little more extreme angle or perspective next time. You''d be surprised at how much "wow" you''d get.</td>', 'Hmmm... not exactly stretching any skills by taking a straight photo of a statue. Try a little more extreme angle or perspective next time. You''d be surprised at how much "wow" you''d get.', '2008-05-27 00:47:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4736067, 666536, 57260, '<td valign="top">ROFLMAO!! I can''t remember the last time a picture made me laugh out loud like that! Excellent humor.</td>', 'ROFLMAO!! I can''t remember the last time a picture made me laugh out loud like that! Excellent humor.', '2008-05-31 11:22:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4736213, 666244, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  I''ve seen this pose before.  You should have borrowed Odyssey''s wings.  :-)</td>', 'Heh!  I''ve seen this pose before.  You should have borrowed Odyssey''s wings.  :-)', '2008-05-31 13:49:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4741353, 667156, 39430, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait of this crazy expression.  I like the slightly grubby look of his face, and the wild hairdo, contrasted with the neat crisp lines of the cut around his ear, and the the suit jacket.  It all works well together.  Nice work.  :)</td>', 'This is a great portrait of this crazy expression.  I like the slightly grubby look of his face, and the wild hairdo, contrasted with the neat crisp lines of the cut around his ear, and the the suit jacket.  It all works well together.  Nice work.  :)', '2008-06-02 10:15:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4754666, 667246, 61961, '<td valign="top">Timothy, this is really a knock-out.  I''m so glad it made the top 20.</td>', 'Timothy, this is really a knock-out.  I''m so glad it made the top 20.', '2008-06-06 18:15:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4754993, 667050, 86447, '<td valign="top">I just love this...<br/> <br/>I gave it a ten during the voting... now that I reconsider, I think it deserves an eleven, instead.   *smile*<br/> <br/>What IS this animal??</td>', 'I just love this... I gave it a ten during the voting... now that I reconsider, I think it deserves an eleven, instead.   *smile* What IS this animal??', '2008-06-06 23:04:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4755437, 667050, 35720, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LydiaToo:</b></div><hr/><i> I just love this...<br/> <br/>I gave it a ten during the voting... now that I reconsider, I think it deserves an eleven, instead.   *smile*<br/> <br/>What IS this animal?? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>This is a young Icelandic horse. <br/>Many thanks Lydia for your kind words.</td>', 'Originally posted by LydiaToo: I just love this... I gave it a ten during the voting... now that I reconsider, I think it deserves an eleven, instead.   *smile* What IS this animal??   This is a young Icelandic horse. Many thanks Lydia for your kind words.', '2008-06-07 06:37:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4773822, 666167, 48228, '<td valign="top">This is stunning..... and so delicate, yet also strong.....<br/>I love the details, focus and lacy patterns. <br/>I also really like the  the tones as they work so well with this composition. <br/>Adding it to my favorites.....</td>', 'This is stunning..... and so delicate, yet also strong.....I love the details, focus and lacy patterns. I also really like the  the tones as they work so well with this composition. Adding it to my favorites.....', '2008-06-18 02:26:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(4801677, 666695, 77537, '<td valign="top">beautifully caught!</td>', 'beautifully caught!', '2008-07-03 20:32:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4832148, 665824, 91131, '<td valign="top">Yes I see where this needs some more work - thanks for comments!</td>', 'Yes I see where this needs some more work - thanks for comments!', '2008-07-18 06:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4862369, 667083, 97054, '<td valign="top">What a an amazing photograph.  Impressed by your work all ready!</td>', 'What a an amazing photograph.  Impressed by your work all ready!', '2008-08-03 22:31:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4883475, 667246, 14476, '<td valign="top">wow.  Incredibly well done.</td>', 'wow.  Incredibly well done.', '2008-08-12 18:05:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(4919482, 667370, 70661, '<td valign="top">This is awesome! It looks so...wet!</td>', 'This is awesome! It looks so...wet!', '2008-08-29 10:51:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4923256, 666237, 54645, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, clearly her parents forgot to feed her before the game. From my interpretation of the image, there is no irony that there is a food bag in the foreground, and only her mouth and hands are lit. Do you have a BW version to share?</td>', 'I like this shot, clearly her parents forgot to feed her before the game. From my interpretation of the image, there is no irony that there is a food bag in the foreground, and only her mouth and hands are lit. Do you have a BW version to share?', '2008-08-31 16:14:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4955561, 667246, 48228, '<td valign="top">Excellent score, for an excellent image, and I love it.....</td>', 'Excellent score, for an excellent image, and I love it.....', '2008-09-15 01:38:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5025815, 667157, 43434, '<td valign="top">Chalie .. this is fantastic shot of Joyah ... keep up the great work!!</td>', 'Chalie .. this is fantastic shot of Joyah ... keep up the great work!!', '2008-10-26 16:28:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5033566, 667174, 47906, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful shot, I love your control of the DOF and the color blue of the flower. Great detail and composition.</td>', 'Very beautiful shot, I love your control of the DOF and the color blue of the flower. Great detail and composition.', '2008-10-30 19:34:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5066071, 667289, 42601, '<td valign="top">This vis very nice. it''s a pity the tree is cropped off the top - or just at its extreme - but still a very nice, processed study.</td>', 'This vis very nice. it''s a pity the tree is cropped off the top - or just at its extreme - but still a very nice, processed study.', '2008-11-16 02:39:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5067248, 666774, 57775, '<td valign="top">WOW - that settles it.  I''m getting the 105 macro lens.  Amazing, beautiful detail.  Great photo Enzo!</td>', 'WOW - that settles it.  I''m getting the 105 macro lens.  Amazing, beautiful detail.  Great photo Enzo!', '2008-11-17 02:27:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5110250, 667196, 62187, '<td valign="top">I had one of these growing in my backyard for over 10 years. It finally died at the end of last summer - I''ll miss it. It''s called a ''Desert Globe Mallow''.</td>', 'I had one of these growing in my backyard for over 10 years. It finally died at the end of last summer - I''ll miss it. It''s called a ''Desert Globe Mallow''.', '2008-12-05 17:16:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5126982, 665896, 63269, '<td valign="top">The way you made the subject slightly out of focus is completely perfect. I love how plain it is that she she is still the subject here, thanks to the fact that the composition leads the eyes right to her. It enhances the "invisible" concept so strongly that the viewer could probably get that impression  even without the title. Bravo.</td>', 'The way you made the subject slightly out of focus is completely perfect. I love how plain it is that she she is still the subject here, thanks to the fact that the composition leads the eyes right to her. It enhances the "invisible" concept so strongly that the viewer could probably get that impression  even without the title. Bravo.', '2008-12-12 12:22:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5163777, 667246, 49804, '<td valign="top">Fantastic, almost looks like a painting, great tones, neat job with the composition too, very well done.</td>', 'Fantastic, almost looks like a painting, great tones, neat job with the composition too, very well done.', '2009-01-01 18:57:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5167570, 666736, 49804, '<td valign="top">Really neat shot, only minor nitpick is that I would prefer the front petals to be in focus rather than the rear flowers while keeping the center in focus, just a minor nitpick, this is a fabulous idea and an incredible job with it, very well done.</td>', 'Really neat shot, only minor nitpick is that I would prefer the front petals to be in focus rather than the rear flowers while keeping the center in focus, just a minor nitpick, this is a fabulous idea and an incredible job with it, very well done.', '2009-01-03 12:50:44.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5168250, 667195, 61651, '<td valign="top">There''s something very appealing about the black circle of the cup surrounded by the black square of the frame - this works very well to keep the supposedly "boring" centered comp from being so.</td>', 'There''s something very appealing about the black circle of the cup surrounded by the black square of the frame - this works very well to keep the supposedly "boring" centered comp from being so.', '2009-01-03 17:30:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5173146, 666296, 73942, '<td valign="top">precious capture, B&amp;W works well here</td>', 'precious capture, B&W works well here', '2009-01-05 16:45:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5213762, 667083, 11078, '<td valign="top">WoW really great photography</td>', 'WoW really great photography', '2009-01-23 01:40:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5513077, 666357, 31637, '<td valign="top">Very nice components in the frame, all compliment eachother, nothing feels out of place or distracting here.</td>', 'Very nice components in the frame, all compliment eachother, nothing feels out of place or distracting here.', '2009-06-03 22:07:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5522765, 666972, 28322, '<td valign="top">Very underrated picture for sure, wonderful technicality and strobe usage, <br/>I think it would''ve been stronger if it was taken at night, my humble opinion, <br/>very well done, regards,</td>', 'Very underrated picture for sure, wonderful technicality and strobe usage, I think it would''ve been stronger if it was taken at night, my humble opinion, very well done, regards,', '2009-06-10 13:49:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5578912, 667246, 99263, '<td valign="top">This sure is incredibly beautiful.</td>', 'This sure is incredibly beautiful.', '2009-07-19 08:15:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5601427, 665482, 16912, '<td valign="top">Greetings from Andi via the (archived request)Critique Club.<br/> <br/><b>First Impression:</b> A fun image and reading your comments it must have been a fun shot to do. I''d have preferred to see more detail in the bubbles, have viewed this image on 3 monitors now and they all lack detail.<br/> <br/><b>Composition:</b> I for one don''t mind the tilt of but would have liked to have seen Charlie more central in the frame.<br/> <br/><b>Subject:</b> Great idea and it looks as if Charlie enjoyed doing this as I''m sure his first girlfriend will when you pull out the album lol.<br/> <br/><b>Technical:</b> I''ve mentioned the missing detail in the bubbles and am guessing whilst it was hot water (hence the redness) this could have been sorted during post processing? Good catchlights always help portraits and these are spot on.<br/> <br/><b>Final thoughts:</b> Overall a very nice image that might have scored higher if Charlie was more central and I also agree with the tighter crop comment.</td>', 'Greetings from Andi via the (archived request)Critique Club. First Impression: A fun image and reading your comments it must have been a fun shot to do. I''d have preferred to see more detail in the bubbles, have viewed this image on 3 monitors now and they all lack detail. Composition: I for one don''t mind the tilt of but would have liked to have seen Charlie more central in the frame. Subject: Great idea and it looks as if Charlie enjoyed doing this as I''m sure his first girlfriend will when you pull out the album lol. Technical: I''ve mentioned the missing detail in the bubbles and am guessing whilst it was hot water (hence the redness) this could have been sorted during post processing? Good catchlights always help portraits and these are spot on. Final thoughts: Overall a very nice image that might have scored higher if Charlie was more central and I also agree with the tighter crop comment.', '2009-08-06 14:12:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5723231, 666604, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohmy. This is macro art at its best!  Flawless perfection!</td>', 'Ohmy. This is macro art at its best!  Flawless perfection!', '2009-11-11 11:30:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5723696, 666604, 90495, '<td valign="top">Coolio!</td>', 'Coolio!', '2009-11-11 18:46:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(5723697, 666167, 90495, '<td valign="top">Very nice.<br/> <br/>PFFT. Leaving comments on dead accounts is lame. We should be warned that the account is no longer active so we don''t waste our time on useless images.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-11-11 18:47:45.</i></td>', 'Very nice. PFFT. Leaving comments on dead accounts is lame. We should be warned that the account is no longer active so we don''t waste our time on useless images.', '2009-11-11 18:46:44.000000', '2009-11-11 18:47:45.000000', 0),
(5875043, 667246, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice job. The focus is nice and sharp and it just seems to radiate.</td>', 'Very nice job. The focus is nice and sharp and it just seems to radiate.', '2010-02-21 12:06:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(6086383, 666700, 74911, '<td valign="top">Great eye!<br/> <br/>I would have cropped differently. I would have cropped some more on left and right and left some more room on the top. And there is a small black area towards the right top edge of the frame, which I would have removed.</td>', 'Great eye! I would have cropped differently. I would have cropped some more on left and right and left some more room on the top. And there is a small black area towards the right top edge of the frame, which I would have removed.', '2010-07-09 11:40:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6108729, 667405, 40718, '<td valign="top">The composition is what you did right.  Centered loves symmetry which you provide.  However, you add in a dash of diagonal energy and you have a nice picture.  It''s a tough one for the rest.  The image looks soft to me and that''s bad, BUT it''s an image that I can see would oversharpen VERY quickly so you might be stuck with it.</td>', 'The composition is what you did right.  Centered loves symmetry which you provide.  However, you add in a dash of diagonal energy and you have a nice picture.  It''s a tough one for the rest.  The image looks soft to me and that''s bad, BUT it''s an image that I can see would oversharpen VERY quickly so you might be stuck with it.', '2010-07-29 16:18:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6275956, 667403, 125794, '<td valign="top">good shot.</td>', 'good shot.', '2011-01-08 01:07:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(6933525, 666661, 5112, '<td valign="top">In my picky mind, I am sitting here wishing the lines of the blinds behind the vase were perfectly parallel to the edges of the photo.  On the other hand, perfect perfection is overrated, and often makes for boring photographs.  I like this photo.</td>', 'In my picky mind, I am sitting here wishing the lines of the blinds behind the vase were perfectly parallel to the edges of the photo.  On the other hand, perfect perfection is overrated, and often makes for boring photographs.  I like this photo.', '2012-12-15 13:12:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(7071081, 666015, 3936, '<td valign="top">Awwww....  Your first froggie...</td>', 'Awwww....  Your first froggie...', '2013-07-15 23:31:36.000000', NULL, 0);
COMMIT;
